   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RWI Reg Afrika prog 08-10</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till Raoul Wallengerg Institutet f&#xF6;r deras regionala Afrikaprogram 2008-2010. Huvudm&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att jobba f&#xF6;r rimlig och h&#xE5;llbar utveckling i SSA genom &#xF6;kat och r&#xE4;ttighetsbaserat deltagande av traditionella ledare. Samt st&#xE4;rka akademiska program och  institutioner inom m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter och f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttrade program och policys f&#xF6;r m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter f&#xF6;r kvinnor.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Raoul Wallenberg Institute&apos;s Regional Africa Programme 2008-2010. The main objective is to promote equitable and sustainable development in SSA by increased and rights-based participation of traditional leaders in governance. And also strengthen academic programmes and institutions in the field of human rights and improved programmes and policies for the human rights for women.</narrative>
  </description>
